//avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-18T15:41:48Z","updated_at":"2024-11-18T15:41:48Z","body":"I can reproduce this, I'm not sure if its solvable. The source model looks too be pretty low poly. The LOD generation algorithm tries to maintain as much quality as possible and at some point it won't reduce poly count any further.\r\n\r\n\r\nHere is how the model looks\r\n<img width=\"619\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-11-18 at 7 35 45 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0fca6712-8f8e-4251-8c47-8c1d8c463514\">\r\n\r\n<img width=\"616\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-11-18 at 7 35 58 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f844014e-b7f6-4233-ab11-26104b50ec90\">","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2483412985/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2485171831","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99395#issuecomment-2485171831","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99395","id":2485171831,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UILZ3","user":{"login":"Sandstorm-mt","id":138675798,"node_id":"U_kgDOCEQGVg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138675798?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandstorm-mt","html_url":"https://github.com/Sandstorm-mt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandstorm-mt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandstorm-mt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandstorm-mt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandstorm-mt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandstorm-mt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandstorm-mt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandstorm-mt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandstorm-mt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandstorm-mt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T09:36:10Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T09:36:10Z","body":"I did more testing and it was true, LOD generating is completely fine with higher polygon count models.\r\nLOD generation isn`t supported by low-poly models, i presume.\r\nSolved.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2485171831/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2485850798","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99395#issuecomment-2485850798","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99395","id":2485850798,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UKxKu","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T14:20:22Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T14:23:15Z","body":">  LOD generation isn`t supported by low-poly models, i presume.\r\n\r\nThis is indeed the case: there's a threshold in vertex count below which LODs are never generated, as generating LODs wouldn't bring much of a performance benefit. In fact, it can be the opposite, as using LODs means the engine needs to keep track of the object's size on screen to switch between LODs. This process has a (small but non-negligible) overhead in itself.\r\n\r\nI believe the minimum vertex count for LOD generation to occur is somewhere around 256 vertices, but I don't remember exactly.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2485850798/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]